//! Firmware parity of the compressor gain computer (`0x120630`): golden vectors.
//!
//! Derived values only (input, output and context float32 / integer words), generated by
//! `python tools/fx_routine_models.py golden compressor > <this file>`
//! from the model that matches the `sharc-fx` run of the firmware routine word for word on
//! 2,100 random scenarios and on this 6-block scenario with the state carried between blocks
//! (`docs/research/fx-type-map.md` s7).

